Look, the way to handle credit cards is simple: just have the "bank" send
you a bill, delivered as an ordinary scroll of mail by the mail demon.  
Instead of containing mail, though, the scroll of mail would contain a
bill, which gives you the oppotunity to pay it (with a certain "minimum
payment"!) when read.

If your bills go unpaid or ignored too often, however, retribution may be
harsh (send in the Kops?).

